<section class="section"><div class="container grid two">
  <article class="card"><h3>HawkSoft online migration</h3><p>Project-managed/coordinated customer database moves between local networks and HawkSoft Online. Richard also helped move hundreds of users from a prior online service to a substantially improved one, supporting customers through the technical and workflow transition.</p></article>
  <article class="card"><h3>HawkSoft accounting-software redesign</h3><p>Led staff readiness for a major accounting-software change: communicated the change and expectations six months in advance, arranged biweekly developer/staff education during the final two months, provided extra support and access to developers/management at go-live, and continued training for months afterward.</p></article>
