<section class="section tight"><div class="container"><p class="small"><strong>Scope note:</strong> This page describes transferable implementation/onboarding/enablement experience. It does not claim formal product-roadmap ownership, formal UAT/defect ownership, or years in a dedicated Implementation Manager title.</p></div></section>
